      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "36566DE3B8700EE5",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0101(0001)] appears to be doing\\nwell—and\\r\\nI\\r\\ndon’t\\r\\nthink\\r\\nit’s\\r\\nusing\\r\\nFacade.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
