    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_sp",
      "hash64": "3587BCE3B7C0F8E7",
      "text": "The boss contacted me the other day...\\c\\nShe said you’d given my name when asked about\\nyour favorite Gym Leader.\\c\\nI really don’t understand your choice. Why would\\nyou pick an average Joe like me?\\c\\nMaybe you’re overworked and it’s affecting your\\njudgment...? I know a good park where you could\\r\\ngo to unwind, if that’s the case.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
